------------------------------- MODULE EvenNumberTransition -------------------------------

CONSTANTS
    Init, Next

VARIABLES
    x

Init == x = 0

Next ==
    /\ \/ x' = x
       \/ (x' \in {0, 2, 4, 6, 8} /\ x < x')
       \/ (x' \in {0, 2, 4, 6, 8} /\ x > x')

Spec == Init /\ [][Next]_<<x>>

=============================================================================